---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { PRICING_VIDEO_FILTER } from '../data/heroGrading';
import { contactEmail } from '../data/site';

const lastUpdated = 'July 8, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Aex Meridian"
  description="How Aex Meridian, LLC collects, uses, and protects information submitted through this website, and our data-handling standard for client AI agents."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content">
    <PageHero
      video="/videos/pricing-bg.mp4"
      videoId="privacy-hero-loop"
      eyebrow="Legal"
      title="Privacy Policy"
      subhead="How we handle the information you share with us — no fine print you need a lawyer to parse."
      objectPosition="center 65%"
      videoFilter={PRICING_VIDEO_FILTER}
    />

    <section class="section legal-body">
      <div class="container legal-container">
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit the contact form on this site, we collect the
          information you provide: business name, your name, email address, phone
          number (optional), current website URL (optional), and any message you
          include. We don't collect information through any other means, and we don't
          use tracking pixels, ad networks, or behavioral advertising cookies.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <p>
          We use the information you submit solely to respond to your inquiry,
          evaluate whether we're a good fit for your business, and follow up about our
          services. We don't sell, rent, or share your information with third parties
          for marketing purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>This site relies on a small number of third-party services to function:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Resend (resend.com)</strong> delivers the contact form's
            submission to us by email on our behalf. Resend does not run in your
            browser — the form submits directly to our own server, which relays it
            to Resend. Resend's own privacy policy governs how they handle that
            transmission.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Fonts</strong> are loaded from Google's servers to display
            the site's typography. Loading a font may share your IP address and
            browser information with Google, per Google's privacy practices.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Chatbase (chatbase.co)</strong> powers the live chat agent demo
            on our homepage. Messages you send in that demo are processed by
            Chatbase to generate a response — it's a public demo of our own
            product, not a private support channel, so please don't share
            sensitive personal information in it. Chatbase's own privacy policy
            governs how they handle that data.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This site does not set first-party tracking cookies. Google Fonts and
          the Chatbase demo (both above) may set their own cookies or use local
          browser storage as part of their normal operation — we don't control
          this directly, and each provider's own privacy policy applies. We don't
          use any cookie-based advertising or analytics on this site.
        </p>

        <h2>Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain information submitted through the contact form for as long as
          reasonably necessary to respond to your inquiry and maintain business
          records, after which it may be deleted.
        </p>

        <h2>AI agent services</h2>
        <p>
          As part of our services, we build AI agents — chat, voice, and workflow —
          configured for individual client businesses. Those agents may process
          conversations between a client and that client's own customers, which can
          include names, phone numbers, and the reason for contact. Our standard
          practice is to log those conversations only for quality review and
          troubleshooting, retain them for a limited period, and never repurpose or
          resell that data. This describes our operating standard as the developer of
          those agents — each client site we build carries its own disclosure
          covering that specific business's data handling, since this policy governs
          aexmeridian.co only.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can request that we delete any information you've submitted to us at any
          time by emailing <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the
          top reflects the most recent revision.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-body {
    background: var(--color-white);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .legal-container :global(h2) {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-container :global(h2:first-of-type) {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-container :global(p),
  .legal-container :global(li) {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .legal-container :global(ul) {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: var(--space-2) 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-1);
  }

  .legal-container :global(strong) {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .legal-container :global(a) {
    /* .legal-body is --color-white — plain --color-steel is ~3.7:1 there and
       fails AA for this body-text link size; on-light variant matches the
       rest of the site's light-background convention. */
    color: var(--color-steel-on-light);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
